  <span style=\"flex:1\">📄 Design-guidelines.md</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Yesterday</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">···</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:56px;width:132px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Rename</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Copy link</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Delete</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"position:relative;height:158px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Workbench</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;font-size:12px\">🔔</span>\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand-light)\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:14px;top:44px;width:158px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 12px 5px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px\">Alex Chen</b> <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">fox@museon.app</span></div>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Personal homepage</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">Account settings</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Log out</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1\">Unnamed document.md</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700\">B</span>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;font-style:italic\">I</span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px\">File ▾</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:68%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:86%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:12px;top:38px;width:172px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save as <span class=\"dropdown-key\">⇧⌘S</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Export PDF<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Weekly Report · Issue 29</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Save</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"font-size:12px;border-color:var(--brand);color:var(--brand)\">More ▾</button>\n      </div>\n      <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%;margin-top:7px\"></i>\n      <div class=\"dropdown-panel\" style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:48px;width:136px;min-width:0;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Export to PDF</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">Print</span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Historical version</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"dropdown-demo\">\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">更多操作 ▾</button></div>\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-panel\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">重命名</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\">复制链接</span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sep\"><span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">删除</span>\n      </span></div>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dropdown-demo\">\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">More actions ▾</button></div>\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-panel\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Rename</span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item\">Copy link</span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sep\"><span class=\"dropdown-sep\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">Delete</span>\n      </span></div>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"trigger","cn":"触发器","en":"Trigger","desc":"按钮或文字，点击展开菜单","desc_en":"A button or text control that opens the menu"},{"key":"panel","cn":"菜单面板","en":"Panel","desc":"浮层，点击外部自动收起","desc_en":"A floating menu that closes when someone clicks outside it"},{"key":"item","cn":"菜单项","en":"MenuItem","desc":"一个动作，可带图标和快捷键","desc_en":"An action can have icons and shortcut keys"},{"key":"sep","cn":"分隔线","en":"Divider","desc":"给菜单项分组，危险操作通常单独一组","desc_en":"Group related menu items; separate destructive actions"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础菜单","en":"Basic","demo":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">重命名</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">复制链接</span><span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">删除</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Rename</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Copy link</span><span class=\"dropdown-item danger\">Delete</span></div>","when":"一组相关操作需要共享同一个入口时","when_en":"When related actions need to share one entry point"},{"cn":"带快捷键","en":"Shortcut","demo":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">保存<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">导出<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Save<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘S</span></span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Export<span class=\"dropdown-key\">⌘E</span></span></div>","when":"高频操作已定义键盘快捷键时","when_en":"When common actions have keyboard shortcuts"},{"cn":"带分组","en":"Grouped","demo":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-group\">视图</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">紧凑模式</span><span class=\"dropdown-group\">操作</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">导出</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dropdown-panel\"><span class=\"dropdown-group\">View</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Compact Mode</span><span class=\"dropdown-group\">Operation</span><span class=\"dropdown-item\">Export</span></div>","when":"菜单包含多类操作，需要按类别分组时","when_en":"The menu contains multiple types of operations and needs to be grouped by category"}],"use":[{"t":"一个入口带<b>多个相关动作</b>：「更多 ▾」","m":"dropdown-actions"},{"t":"用户头像下的<b>账户菜单</b>","m":"dropdown-user"},{"t":"把<b>低频操作收进「更多」</b>，主界面更干净","m":"dropdown-more"},{"t":"带<b>分组、快捷键</b>的命令菜单","m":"dropdown-cmd"}],"dont":[{"t":"只需<b>从几个值中选择一个</b>：使用 {c:select}","m":"dropdown-as-select","bad":true},{"t":"菜单中<b>只有一项操作</b>：直接使用按钮","m":"dropdown-single","bad":true},{"t":"把<b>核心操作</b>藏进下拉，会降低入口的可发现性","m":"dropdown-hidden","bad":true},{"t":"多层嵌套下拉菜单容易因指针偏离而关闭，应改用分组或独立页面","m":"dropdown-nested","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"每一行项目都有“重命名、复制、归档”。怎样避免列表里挤满按钮？","options":[{"id":"dropdown","label":"把三个次要操作收进同一个菜单，并保留文字","feedback":"对。与同一对象相关的次要动作可以放进菜单，但不能只靠图标让人猜。","correct":true},{"id":"three-icons","label":"每行保留三个图标按钮，只在鼠标悬停时显示名称","feedback":"图标含义常有歧义，尤其是低频或有风险的动作。","correct":false},{"id":"select-value","label":"把三个操作都放进右键菜单，行内不再保留任何入口","feedback":"右键菜单可以作为补充，但不能作为唯一入口；触屏和不熟悉右键的用户很难发现这些操作。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Each project row has Rename, Duplicate, and Archive. How do you avoid a row full of buttons?","options":[{"id":"dropdown","label":"Use an inline Dropdown for these related secondary actions, with clear text when opened","feedback":"Correct. Related secondary commands can share a menu, but should not rely on guessed icons.","correct":true},{"id":"three-icons","label":"Use three unlabeled icons per row; people will learn them","feedback":"Icons are often ambiguous, especially for infrequent or risky actions.","correct":false},{"id":"select-value","label":"Treat an action as a form value and save it through a Select","feedback":"These are immediate commands on the current row, not a persistent field value.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把项目行的重命名、复制和归档收进一个 Dropdown，菜单项使用文字；归档执行前保留确认。逐一打开并执行可逆操作，确认菜单作用于当前那一行且键盘也能打开和关闭。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Put Rename, Duplicate, and Archive for each project row in a Dropdown with text labels; keep confirmation before Archive. Open and run reversible actions one by one, confirming the menu targets its current row and is fully keyboard-operable."}},"references":[{"title":"菜单按钮模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/menu-button/","title_en":"Menu Button Pattern"}],"scenes":["表格行「更多操作」","用户头像账户菜单","编辑器命令菜单","工具栏低频操作收纳"],"en":{"